cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Pampa CBERS-4A Land Cover"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Paim de Cerqueira Melo de Souza"
    given-names: "João Victor"
    affiliation: "Instituto Militar de Engenharia"
abstract: >-
  Pixel-level land cover annotations for 100 CBERS-4A WPM tiles over the Pampa
  biome in Rio Grande do Sul, Brazil, at 2 m/px, in the 7-class DeepGlobe
  taxonomy. Tiles are 1024 x 1024 px and come from 34 scenes acquired between
  2020 and 2026, selected by a reproducible stratified sampling procedure with a
  spatial exclusion buffer between the train and test partitions. Released with
  the 4-band Int16 GeoTIFFs the annotations were made over, and with the full
  rendering parameters needed to reproduce the 8-bit composites.
keywords:
  - land cover
  - semantic segmentation
  - remote sensing
  - CBERS-4A
  - Pampa
  - Brazil
  - DeepGlobe
